{"sections":[{"slug":"平坦概形态射","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"平坦概形态射"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">平坦概形态射</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“平坦概形态射”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">是平坦的是指</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对每个点</span> $x\\in X$,\n$$\r\n\\mathcal O_{Y,f(x)} \\to \\mathcal O_{X,x}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">都是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/平坦环同态","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">平坦环同态</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}